{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/4a90be884797cdae620d5e70b30a4271.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/4a90be884797cdae620d5e70b30a4271.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/3901d8c9bedc15f8c58cd4a28b011135.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/3901d8c9bedc15f8c58cd4a28b011135.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=245 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tiny Bakery, you run a small bakery for cute slime customers. You\u2019ll juggle multi-step recipes and keep track of all your bowls in a busy, chaotic kitchen. Weather and special events change what your customers want, and the in-game radio gives hints so you can plan ahead. As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock new recipes, new slimes, and even special guests with unique orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/2c426392137d300ac799d913affcebe9.poster.avif?t=1765833128\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/2c426392137d300ac799d913affcebe9.webm?t=1765833128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/2c426392137d300ac799d913affcebe9.mp4?t=1765833128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/2e87ac88a0eacdb6e38e670c12201754.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/2e87ac88a0eacdb6e38e670c12201754.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather and special events affect what your slime customers want. Rainy days might bring cravings for warm treats like hot chocolate, while sunny festival days increase demand for fresh lemon muffins. The radio gives hints so you can prepare in advance and plan your day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/e7a06cbdfdc077e3dd38231008c565ca.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/e7a06cbdfdc077e3dd38231008c565ca.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a busy day of baking and serving, the night is when you get everything ready for the next day. You\u2019ll clean up, restock ingredients, and prep some recipes in advance to stay ahead of your slime customers\u2019 cravings. Listening to the radio helps you plan for the weather and special events, so you can organize your kitchen and choose which items to prepare. Nighttime adds a calm, cozy rhythm to the sometimes chaotic bakery days and gives you a moment to plan your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/880b977585ecd5561951daa0c5d27ece.poster.avif?t=1765833128\" width=660 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/880b977585ecd5561951daa0c5d27ece.webm?t=1765833128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/880b977585ecd5561951daa0c5d27ece.mp4?t=1765833128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/fff0c0f59bf665b9f1dfd2b68d58ae62.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/fff0c0f59bf665b9f1dfd2b68d58ae62.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/2d937eee23d915c62257c3172bf11c8a.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/2d937eee23d915c62257c3172bf11c8a.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customers are cute, colorful slimes, each with their own tastes. As you play, you\u2019ll meet new types of slimes with bigger appetites and trickier orders. Sometimes a special guest slime will visit with a unique request, keeping things interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/6e3ebbd1db6da0fe5047a628d033fe78.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/6e3ebbd1db6da0fe5047a628d033fe78.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=459 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/c9f93adbb8298fb4c65ce871019ef056.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/c9f93adbb8298fb4c65ce871019ef056.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/deb543d06cd1267dc15295155aaa5f45.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/deb543d06cd1267dc15295155aaa5f45.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=1742 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/6915b8da6ab415f21569c0661a029706.poster.avif?t=1765833128\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/6915b8da6ab415f21569c0661a029706.webm?t=1765833128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/6915b8da6ab415f21569c0661a029706.mp4?t=1765833128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/c7c22d67c9c943e2d00430d52e5d44a1.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/c7c22d67c9c943e2d00430d52e5d44a1.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you\u2019ll unlock new recipes, kitchen equipment, and slime guests. Each new recipe adds variety, and new slimes bring fresh challenges. Special guests occasionally arrive with unique requests, keeping your bakery lively and interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/69425fd9722fc24fdcefdd5412d5901c.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/69425fd9722fc24fdcefdd5412d5901c.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=263 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bake and serve multi-step recipes in a busy, chaotic kitchen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prep, clean, and restock in a continuous day-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather and events affect customer cravings, adding replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new recipes, equipment, and slime guests over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a cozy, fun, and chaotic bakery experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/f1273695e75d3e9c51d977b5f324cb8e.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/f1273695e75d3e9c51d977b5f324cb8e.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/458dfd6314cff393f1f16e4d683fb97b.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/458dfd6314cff393f1f16e4d683fb97b.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=563 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Bakery is still in development. It will be released in 2026 and a demo is coming soon,\u00a0you can wishlist the game to stay updated on the progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951340?t=1765833128","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951340?t=1765833128","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/cb987a47d424009b24215cf20e650366a019d99d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765833128","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/cb987a47d424009b24215cf20e650366a019d99d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765833128","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4096930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/4a90be884797cdae620d5e70b30a4271.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/4a90be884797cdae620d5e70b30a4271.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=308 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/3901d8c9bedc15f8c58cd4a28b011135.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/3901d8c9bedc15f8c58cd4a28b011135.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=245 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tiny Bakery, you run a small bakery for cute slime customers. You\u2019ll juggle multi-step recipes and keep track of all your bowls in a busy, chaotic kitchen. Weather and special events change what your customers want, and the in-game radio gi