ight is when you get everything ready for the next day. You\u2019ll clean up, restock ingredients, and prep some recipes in advance to stay ahead of your slime customers\u2019 cravings. Listening to the radio helps you plan for the weather and special events, so you can organize your kitchen and choose which items to prepare. Nighttime adds a calm, cozy rhythm to the sometimes chaotic bakery days and gives you a moment to plan your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/880b977585ecd5561951daa0c5d27ece.poster.avif?t=1765833128\" width=660 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/880b977585ecd5561951daa0c5d27ece.webm?t=1765833128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/880b977585ecd5561951daa0c5d27ece.mp4?t=1765833128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/fff0c0f59bf665b9f1dfd2b68d58ae62.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/fff0c0f59bf665b9f1dfd2b68d58ae62.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/2d937eee23d915c62257c3172bf11c8a.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/2d937eee23d915c62257c3172bf11c8a.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customers are cute, colorful slimes, each with their own tastes. As you play, you\u2019ll meet new types of slimes with bigger appetites and trickier orders. Sometimes a special guest slime will visit with a unique request, keeping things interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/6e3ebbd1db6da0fe5047a628d033fe78.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/6e3ebbd1db6da0fe5047a628d033fe78.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=459 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/c9f93adbb8298fb4c65ce871019ef056.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/c9f93adbb8298fb4c65ce871019ef056.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=263 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/deb543d06cd1267dc15295155aaa5f45.avif?t=1765833128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras_big/deb543d06cd1267dc15295155aaa5f45.webp?t=1765833128 width=1560 height=1742 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/6915b8da6ab415f21569c0661a029706.poster.avif?t=1765833128\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951340/extras/6915b8da6ab415f21569c0661a029706.webm?t=1765833128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps